volume.description = Check or adjust your rowing sound volume (0–100%).
volume.setDescription = Set your rowing sound volume to a whole number from 0 to 100.
volume.percentage = Volume from 0 to 100 percent
volume.current = Your rowing volume is {percent, number}%. Choose a whole number from 0 to 100, for example {example}.
volume.outOfRange = Enter a volume between 0 and 100.
volume.saved = Rowing volume set to {percent, number}%.
volume.saveFailed = Your rowing volume could not be saved.
opacity.description = Check or adjust the opacity of boat foam (0–100%).
opacity.setDescription = Set the opacity of boat foam to a whole number from 0 to 100.
opacity.percentage = Opacity from 0 to 100 percent
opacity.current = Your boat foam opacity is {percent, number}%. Choose a whole number from 0 to 100, for example {example}.
opacity.outOfRange = Enter an opacity between 0 and 100.
opacity.saved = Boat foam opacity set to {percent, number}%.
opacity.saveFailed = Your boat foam opacity could not be saved.
interaction.description = Check or change your boat interaction mode (board, pick-up, or drop). It only applies when the boat is fully ashore or stranded at the shoreline.
interaction.setDescription = Choose board, pick-up, or drop for boats that are fully ashore or stranded at the shoreline.
interaction.mode = board, pick-up, or drop
interaction.current = Your boat interaction ashore is {mode}. Choose board, pick-up, or drop with /boat_mode.
interaction.invalid = Choose board, pick-up, or drop.
interaction.saved = Boat interaction ashore set to {mode}.
interaction.saveFailed = Your boat interaction preference could not be saved.
